y @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M16 132h416c8.837 0 16-7.163 16-16V76c0-8.837-7.163-16-16-16H16C7.163 60 0 67.163 0 76v40c0 8.837 7.163 16 16 16zm0 160h416c8.837 0 16-7.163 16-16v-40c0-8.837-7.163-16-16-16H16c-8.837 0-16 7.163-16 16v40c0 8.837 7.163 16 16 16zm0 160h416c8.837 0 16-7.163 16-16v-40c0-8.837-7.163-16-16-16H16c-8.837 0-16 7.163-16 16v40c0 8.837 7.163 16 16 16z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n      \n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          copy-code-button\n          tw-select-none\n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden\n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block\n          hover:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\"\n        title=\"Copy code\"\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"copy-icon tw-block\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M433.941 65.941l-51.882-51.882A48 48 0 0 0 348.118 0H176c-26.51 0-48 21.49-48 48v48H48c-26.51 0-48 21.49-48 48v320c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h224c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48v-48h80c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V99.882a48 48 0 0 0-14.059-33.941zM266 464H54a6 6 0 0 1-6-6V150a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h74v224c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h96v42a6 6 0 0 1-6 6zm128-96H182a6 6 0 0 1-6-6V54a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h106v88c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h88v202a6 6 0 0 1-6 6zm6-256h-64V48h9.632c1.591 0 3.117.632 4.243 1.757l48.368 48.368a6 6 0 0 1 1.757 4.243V112z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"check-icon tw-hidden\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n        \n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          tw-select-none \n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-block \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-hidden \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        disabled\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M328 256c0 39.8-32.2 72-72 72s-72-32.2-72-72 32.2-72 72-72 72 32.2 72 72zm104-72c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72zm-352 0c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cpre style=\"counter-reset: codeblock;\" class=\"tw-block tw-m-0 tw-p-0\"\u003e\u003ccode \n    id=\"codeblock-id-1\" \n    class=\"\n      chroma \n      !tw-block \n      tw-p-0\n      tw-m-0\n      tw-transition-[max-height] \n      tw-duration-500 \n      tw-ease-in-out \n      group-[.is-closed]:!tw-max-h-0 \n      group-[.is-wrap]:tw-text-wrap\n      tw-overflow-y-hidden\n      tw-overflow-x-auto\n      tw-scrollbar-thin\n      \"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u0026lt;Thought Process\u0026gt;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e{Thought_Process}\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u0026lt;/Thought Process\u0026gt;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u0026lt;Question\u0026gt;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e{Question}\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u0026lt;/Question\u0026gt;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003eThe \u0026lt;Thought Process\u0026gt; above reflects the model’s reasoning based on the \u0026lt;Question\u0026gt;. Your task is to rewrite the \u0026lt;Thought Process\u0026gt; to resemble a more human-like, intuitive natural thinking process. The new version should:\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e1. Be presented as step-by-step reasoning, with each thought on a new line separated by a line break.\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e2. Avoid structured titles or formatting, focusing on natural transitions. Use casual and natural language for transitions or validations, such as \u0026#34;hmm,\u0026#34; \u0026#34;oh,\u0026#34; \u0026#34;also,\u0026#34; or \u0026#34;wait.\u0026#34;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e3. Expand the content, making the reasoning richer, more detailed, and logically clear while still being conversational and intuitive.\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003eReturn directly the revised natural thinking in JSON format as follows: “‘json {\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u0026#34;NaturalReasoning\u0026#34;: \u0026#34;...\u0026#34;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e基於 Complex CoT 以及 Question 來得到最終 Response 的 Prompt 如下所示：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw-group tw-my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    \n    tw-flex \n    tw-flex-row\n    tw-flex-1 \n    tw-justify-between \n    tw-w-full tw-bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        code-block-button\n        tw-mx-2 \n        tw-flex\n        tw-flex-row\n        tw-flex-1\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\n          \u003cdiv class=\"group-[.is-open]:tw-rotate-90 tw-transition-[transform] tw-duration-500 tw-ease-in-out print:!tw-hidden tw-w-min tw-h-min tw-my-1 tw-mx-1\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cp class=\"tw-select-none !tw-my-1\"\u003etext\u003c/p\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n\n   \u003cdiv class=\"tw-flex\"\u003e\n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          line-number-button\n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block \n          group-[.show-line-numbers]:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        title=\"Toggle line numbers\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M61.77 401l17.5-20.15a19.92 19.92 0 0 0 5.07-14.19v-3.31C84.34 356 80.5 352 73 352H16a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v16a8 8 0 0 0 8 8h22.83a157.41 157.41 0 0 0-11 12.31l-5.61 7c-4 5.07-5.25 10.13-2.8 14.88l1.05 1.93c3 5.76 6.29 7.88 12.25 7.88h4.73c10.33 0 15.94 2.44 15.94 9.09 0 4.72-4.2 8.22-14.36 8.22a41.54 41.54 0 0 1-15.47-3.12c-6.49-3.88-11.74-3.5-15.6 3.12l-5.59 9.31c-3.72 6.13-3.19 11.72 2.63 15.94 7.71 4.69 20.38 9.44 37 9.44 34.16 0 48.5-22.75 48.5-44.12-.03-14.38-9.12-29.76-28.73-34.88zM496 224H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zm0-160H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16V80a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zm0 320H176a16 16 0 0 0-16 16v32a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h320a16 16 0 0 0 16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 0-16-16zM16 160h64a8 8 0 0 0 8-8v-16a8 8 0 0 0-8-8H64V40a8 8 0 0 0-8-8H32a8 8 0 0 0-7.14 4.42l-8 16A8 8 0 0 0 24 64h8v64H16a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v16a8 8 0 0 0 8 8zm-3.91 160H80a8 8 0 0 0 8-8v-16a8 8 0 0 0-8-8H41.32c3.29-10.29 48.34-18.68 48.34-56.44 0-29.06-25-39.56-44.47-39.56-21.36 0-33.8 10-40.46 18.75-4.37 5.59-3 10.84 2.8 15.37l8.58 6.88c5.61 4.56 11 2.47 16.12-2.44a13.44 13.44 0 0 1 9.46-3.84c3.33 0 9.28 1.56 9.28 8.75C51 248.19 0 257.31 0 304.59v4C0 316 5.08 320 12.09 320z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n\n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          wrap-code-button\n          tw-select-none \n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block \n          group-[.is-wrap]:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        title=\"Toggle code wrap\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M16 132h416c8.837 0 16-7.163 16-16V76c0-8.837-7.163-16-16-16H16C7.163 60 0 67.163 0 76v40c0 8.837 7.163 16 16 16zm0 160h416c8.837 0 16-7.163 16-16v-40c0-8.837-7.163-16-16-16H16c-8.837 0-16 7.163-16 16v40c0 8.837 7.163 16 16 16zm0 160h416c8.837 0 16-7.163 16-16v-40c0-8.837-7.163-16-16-16H16c-8.837 0-16 7.163-16 16v40c0 8.837 7.163 16 16 16z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n      \n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          copy-code-button\n          tw-select-none\n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-hidden\n          group-[.is-open]:tw-block\n          hover:tw-text-fgColor-link \n          print:!tw-hidden\"\n        title=\"Copy code\"\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"copy-icon tw-block\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M433.941 65.941l-51.882-51.882A48 48 0 0 0 348.118 0H176c-26.51 0-48 21.49-48 48v48H48c-26.51 0-48 21.49-48 48v320c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h224c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48v-48h80c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V99.882a48 48 0 0 0-14.059-33.941zM266 464H54a6 6 0 0 1-6-6V150a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h74v224c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h96v42a6 6 0 0 1-6 6zm128-96H182a6 6 0 0 1-6-6V54a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h106v88c0 13.255 10.745 24 24 24h88v202a6 6 0 0 1-6 6zm6-256h-64V48h9.632c1.591 0 3.117.632 4.243 1.757l48.368 48.368a6 6 0 0 1 1.757 4.243V112z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"check-icon tw-hidden\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n        \n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          tw-select-none \n          tw-mx-2 \n          tw-block \n          group-[.is-open]:tw-hidden \n          print:!tw-hidden\" \n        disabled\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M328 256c0 39.8-32.2 72-72 72s-72-32.2-72-72 32.2-72 72-72 72 32.2 72 72zm104-72c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72zm-352 0c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cpre style=\"counter-reset: codeblock;\" class=\"tw-block tw-m-0 tw-p-0\"\u003e\u003ccode \n    id=\"codeblock-id-2\" \n    class=\"\n      chroma \n      !tw-block \n      tw-p-0\n      tw-m-0\n      tw-transition-[max-height] \n      tw-duration-500 \n      tw-ease-in-out \n      group-[.is-closed]:!tw-max-h-0 \n      group-[.is-wrap]:tw-text-wrap\n      tw-overflow-y-hidden\n      tw-overflow-x-auto\n      tw-scrollbar-thin\n      \"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u0026lt;Internal Thinking\u0026gt;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e{Complex_CoT}\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u0026lt;/Internal Thinking\u0026gt;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u0026lt;Question\u0026gt;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e{Question}\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u0026lt;/Question\u0026gt;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003eThe \u0026lt;Internal Thinking\u0026gt; represents your internal thoughts about the \u0026lt;Question\u0026gt;. Based on this, generate a rich and high-quality final response to the user. If there is a clear answer, provide it first. Ensure your final response closely follows the \u0026lt;Question\u0026gt;. The response style should resemble GPT-4’s style as much as possible. Output only your final response, without any additional content.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e最後，作者將原來 40k 個 Data Sample (Question-Answer Pair) 中的 20k 個抽取出來，進行上述的流程。因此，目前就擁有 20k 個 (Question, Complex Rationale, Response) Tuples，以及 20k 個 (Question, Answer) Pairs。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"huatuogpt-o1-3-step-supervised-fine-tuning\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#huatuogpt-o1-3-step-supervised-fine-tuning\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e5 HuatuoGPT-o1 #3 Step: Supervised Fine-Tuning\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e此步驟的目的在於讓 LLM 學習輸出先 Long Chain-of-Thought Style 的 Rationale，再得到最後的 Response。因此，此階段主要是基於 20k 個 (Question, Complex Rationale, Response) Tuples。LLM 的輸入為 Question，而輸出為 Complex Rationale + Response。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"huatuogpt-o1-4-step-reinforcement-learning\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#huatuogpt-o1-4-step-reinforcement-learning\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e6 HuatuoGPT-o1 #4 Step: Reinforcement Learning\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e為了更進一步優化模型的推理能力，作者還透過剩下的 20k 個 (Question, Answer) Pairs 搭配 PPO 來訓練模型。在 Reward 的計算上，主要是透過 Verifier 來比較 LLM 的 Output 以及 Ground-truth Answer 來決定：\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/paper-intro/huatuogpt-o1-towards-medical-complex-reasoning-with-llms/raward_function.png\" title=\"\" data-thumbnail=\"/paper-intro/huatuogpt-o1-towards-medical-complex-reasoning-with-llms/raward_function.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eReward Function in HuatuoGPT-o1\u003c/h2\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src='/paper-intro/huatuogpt-o1-towards-medical-complex-reasoning-with-llms/raward_function.png' srcset=\"/paper-intro/huatuogpt-o1-towards-medical-complex-reasoning-with-llms/raward_function_hu_fcde2733edbceff9.webp 800w, /paper-intro/huatuogpt-o1-towards-medical-complex-reasoning-with-llms/raward_function_hu_d1f53b0421f10dc8.webp 1200w, /paper-intro/huatuogpt-o1-towards-medical-complex-reasoning-with-llms/raward_function_hu_7a2db94b5eb4e215.webp 1600w\"   height=\"174\" width=\"804\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eReward Function in HuatuoGPT-o1\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n    \u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e比較有趣的是，如果 LLM 推理出錯誤的答案，然仍會得到一個 Positive Reward（只是比較少），但是當 LLM 的 Output 沒有遵守先 Think-before-Answering 的行為模式時，就不會得到 Reward。為了在 Sparse Reward 下能有穩定的學習，最後的 Reward Function 中還會加上 KL Divergence，避免 Update 太多和 Initial Policy 差距太大。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"huatuogpt-o1-的實驗表現\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#huatuogpt-o1-%e7%9a%84%e5%af%a6%e9%a9%97%e8%a1%a8%e7%8f%be\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e7 HuatuoGPT-o1 的實驗表現\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e在模型訓練的細節上，作者基於 Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct 與 70B 訓練出 HuatuoGPT-o1-8B 與 70B。值得注意的是，在 Stage 1 的 SFT 的 LR 僅設定 5e-6 而 Stage 2 的 RL 的 LR 僅設定 5e-7。從下表 Table 1 也可以看到 HuatuoGPT 的表現比 Baseline 來得更好。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightgallery\" href=\"/paper-intro/huatuogpt-o1-towards-medical-complex-reasoning-with-llms/table-1.png\" title=\"\" data-thumbnail=\"/paper-intro/huatuogpt-o1-towards-medical-complex-reasoning-with-llms/table-1.png\" data-sub-html=\"\u003ch2\u003eTable 1: Main Results on Medical Benchmarks. LLMs with \u0026lsquo;capsule\u0026rsquo; emoji are specifically trained for the medical domain, and indicates LLMs training for long chain-of-thought reasoning. \u0026lsquo;w/o\u0026rsquo; means \u0026lsquo;without\u0026rsquo;. Within each segment, bold highlights the best scores, and underlines indicate the second-best.\u003c/h2\u003e\"\u003e\u003cimg  loading=\"lazy\" src='/paper-intro/huatuogpt-o1-towards-medical-complex-reasoning-with-llms/table-1.png' srcset=\"/paper-intro/huatuogpt-o1-towards-medical-complex-reasoning-with-llms/table-1_hu_825c520f91daa609.webp 800w, /paper-intro/huatuogpt-o1-towards-medical-complex-reasoning-with-llms/table-1_hu_163325e43e6158a7.webp 1200w, /paper-intro/huatuogpt-o1-towards-medical-complex-reasoning-with-llms/table-1_hu_e77f51e4355ece05.webp 1600w\"   height=\"651\" width=\"1024\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"image-caption\"\u003eTable 1: Main Results on Medical Benchmarks. LLMs with \u0026lsquo;capsule\u0026rsquo; emoji are specifically trained for the medical domain, and indicates LLMs training for long chain-of-thought reasoning. \u0026lsquo;w/o\u0026rsquo; means \u0026lsquo;without\u0026rsquo;. Within each segment, bold highlights the best scores, and underlines indicate the second-best.\u003c/figcaption\u003e\n    \u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"結語\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e7%b5%90%e8%aa%9e\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e8 結語\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e本篇文章分享 \u003ca href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.18925\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eHuatuoGPT-o1, Towards Medical Complex Reasoning with LLMs (2024/12)\u003c/a\u003e — 一篇針對 Medical Domain 的 o1 模型。讀完 HuatuoGPT-o1 後，我們將能夠學習到\u003cstrong\u003e如何在 Medical Domain 訓練出一個 o1 模型\u003c/strong\u003e。我覺得這篇論文讓我們學習到最多的就是，如何從頭開始且比較低成本的方式 (相較於 OpenAI o1)，建立一個 Domain-Specific 的 o1 模型。包含整體流程該如何設計 (Dataset Collection, Preprocess, Transformation, SFT, RL)，以及 Prompt 該怎麼寫 (Search Strategy, CoT Trajectory to Complex CoT)。\u003c/p\u003e",
        "language": "zh-tw"
    }
    ]
}
